DI3Tools build of CrabeLoader. Applies to tag v1.1.0 (96f866b): in that checkout, git apply crabeloader-no-guards.patch.
EngineMeridian and EngineShaders stay off, so a world that loads with CrabeLoader also loads in vanilla 3.0.

diff --git a/src/application/loader.cpp b/src/application/loader.cpp
